~ beginning
Hericlitus: No man steps in the same river twice, for it is not the same river and he is not the same man
=> END

~ narration
This is the limbo, the space between life and death. 

To move on to the afterlife, you must build your boat using your life’s memories. 

Each stage of the journey, you will be offered 3 memories to choose from to build your boat, which may contribute to the style, sturdiness, and size of your boat.

You start on a mini raft, here is a series of choices (tutorial); [#reveal]
- First one
	You picked the first one.
- Second one
	You picked the second one.
- Start again => narration
- End tutorial => game

~ game
Welcome to your journey! The afterlife demands that you build a boat as you make your way to your desired afterlife. The great beyond’s magic will grant you whatever you desire to reach it. Here is how it’ll work;

Sample card () - Here, you are given a situation, then you make your choice
Decorate your boat +10 style
Add more material +10 sturdiness
Make it bigger!! _+10 size

There will, however, be sacrifices most of the time. Of course, everything comes with a price;
Make it even bigger! +6 size  -5 sturdiness
Strengthen the material +6 sturdiness -5 style
Carve drawings into your raft +6 style -5 size

=> END
